  "problem": "$Γ(15)=$",
  "worked_solution": "For any natural number $n\\ge 1,$ we have\n\n$$\nΓ(n)=(n-1)!\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nΓ(15)=14!\n$$",
